  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project seeks to address poor waste management in two vulnerable communities, which is contributing to environmental degradation, health risks, and economic hardship. The absence of organised waste disposal systems has led to the accumulation of solid waste in living areas, waterways, and public spaces. This results in increased exposure to communicable diseases, and contributes to poor sanitation and reduced quality of life.</narrative>
  </description>
